  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now let,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So, integral becomes,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></munder></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
